{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-1","title":"John 18:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Judas betrays Jesus. 6 The officers fall to the ground. 10 Peter smites off Malchus' ear. 12 Jesus is taken, and led unto Annas and Caiaphas. 15 Peter's denial. 19 Jesus examined before Caiaphas. 25 Peter's second and third denial. 28 Jesus arraigned before Pilate. 36 His kingdom. 40 The Jews prefer Barabbas.</p>\n<p>spoken. 13:31-35; 14:1-17:26 he. 14:31; Mt 26:36; Mr 14:32; Lu 22:39,40 the brook. 2Sa 15:23; 1Ki 15:13; 2Ki 23:6,12; 2Ch 15:16; 30:14; Jer 31:40 Kidron. a garden. 26; Ge 2:15; 3:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-2","title":"John 18:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>for. Mr 11:11,12; Lu 21:37; 22:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-3","title":"John 18:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Judas. 13:2,27-30; Mt 26:47,55; Mr 14:43,44,48; Lu 22:47-53; Ac 1:16 a band. 12; *Gr: Ps 3:1,2; 22:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-4","title":"John 18:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>knowing. 10:17,18; 13:1; 19:28; Mt 16:21; 17:22,23; 20:18,19; 26:2,21,31 Mr 10:33,34; Lu 18:31-33; 24:6,7,44; Ac 2:28; 4:24-28; 20:22-23 Whom. 1Ki 18:10,14-18; Ne 6:11; Ps 3:6; 27:3; Pr 28:1; 1Pe 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-5","title":"John 18:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Jesus. 1:46; 19:19; Mt 2:23; 21:11 stood. Isa 3:9; Jer 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-6","title":"John 18:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>they went.Doubtless by the interposition of Divine power; and it was thus shown that Jesus voluntarily resigned himself into their hands.</p>\n<p>2Ki 1:9-15; Ps 27:2; 40:14; 70:2,3; 129:5; Lu 9:54-56; Ac 4:29,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-8","title":"John 18:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>if. Isa 53:6; Eph 5:25 let. 10:28; 13:1,36; 16:32; Mt 26:56; Mr 14:50-52; 1Co 10:13; 2Co 12:9 1Pe 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-9","title":"John 18:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Of. 17:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-10","title":"John 18:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>26; Mt 26:51-54; Mr 14:30,47; Lu 22:33,49-51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-11","title":"John 18:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Put. 36; 2Co 6:7; 10:4; Eph 6:11-17 the cup. Ps 75:8; Eze 23:31; Mt 20:22; 26:39,42; Mr 10:38,39; 14:35,36 Lu 22:42; Heb 12:2 my. 11:41,42; 12:27,28; 15:10; 17:24; 20:17; Lu 12:30; Ro 8:15-18 Heb 12:5-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-12","title":"John 18:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the band. 3; Mt 26:57; Mr 14:53; Lu 22:54 the captain. Ac 21:31,37; 22:24-28; 23:10,17-22 bound. Ge 22:9; 40:3; Jud 16:21; Ps 118:27; Mt 27:2; Mr 15:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-13","title":"John 18:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>led. Mt 26:57 Annas. Lu 3:2; Ac 4:6 that. 11:51 \"And Annas sent Christ bound unto Caiaphas the high priest, ver. 24.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-14","title":"John 18:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Caiaphas. 11:49-52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-15","title":"John 18:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Simon. Mt 26:58-68; Mr 14:54; Lu 22:54</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-17","title":"John 18:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the damsel. 16; Mt 26:69,70; Mr 14:66-68; Lu 22:54,56,57 I am not. 5,8; 21:15; Mt 26:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-18","title":"John 18:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>who. 25; Mr 14:54; Lu 22:55,56 for. Lu 22:44 Peter. Ge 49:6; 1Ki 19:9; Ps 1:1; 26:4-10; Pr 13:20; Ac 4:23; 1Co 15:33 2Co 6:15-17; Eph 5:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-19","title":"John 18:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>asked. Lu 11:53,54; 20:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-20","title":"John 18:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>I spake. 7:14,26,28; 8:2; 10:23-39; Ps 22:22; 40:9; Mt 4:23; 9:35; 21:23-27 Mt 26:65; Lu 4:15; 19:45-47; 20:1-8; 21:37 and in. 7:4; Isa 45:19; 48:16; Mt 24:26; Ac 26:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-21","title":"John 18:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>ask. Mt 26:59,60; Mr 14:55-59; Lu 22:67; Ac 24:12,13,18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-22","title":"John 18:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>struck. Job 16:10; 30:10-12; Isa 50:5-7; Jer 20:2; Mic 5:1; Mt 26:67,68 Mr 14:65; Lu 22:63,64; Ac 23:2,3 the palm of his hand. or, a rod. Answerest. Ac 23:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-23","title":"John 18:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>If. 2Co 10:1; 1Pe 2:20-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-24","title":"John 18:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Annas.Annas was dismissed from being high priest, A.D. 23, after filling that office for fifteen years; but, being a person of distinguished character, and having had no fewer than five sons who had successively enjoyed the dignity of the high-priesthood, and the present high priest Caiaphas being his son-in-law, he must have possessed much authority in the nation. It was at the palace of Caiaphas where the chief priests, elders, and scribes were assembled the whole of the night to see the issue of their stratagem.</p>\n<p>13; Mt 26:57 bound. 13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-25","title":"John 18:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>stood. 18; Mr 14:37,38,67; Lu 22:56 They. Mt 26:69,71; Mr 14:68-70; Lu 22:58 He. Ge 18:15; Pr 29:25; Ga 2:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-26","title":"John 18:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>being. 10 Did. Pr 12:19; Mt 26:73; Mr 14:70,71; Lu 22:59,60</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-27","title":"John 18:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>and. 13:38; Mt 26:34,74,75; Mr 14:30,68,71,72; Lu 22:34,60-62</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-28","title":"John 18:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>led. Mt 27:1,2-10; Mr 15:1-5; Lu 23:1-5; Ac 3:13 unto. 33; 19:9; Mt 27:27; Mr 15:16; *Gr: hall of judgment. or, Pilate's house. early. Pr 1:16; 4:16; Mic 2:1; Lu 22:66 and they. Ps 35:16; Isa 1:10-15; Jer 7:8-11; Am 5:21-23; Mic 3:10-12 Mt 23:23-28; 27:6; Ac 10:28; 11:3 eat. 39; 19:14; De 16:2; 2Ch 30:21-24; 35:8-14,17,18; Eze 45:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-29","title":"John 18:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>What. Mt 27:23; Ac 23:28-30; 25:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-30","title":"John 18:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>If. 19:12; Mr 15:3; Lu 20:19-26; 23:2-5 delivered. Mr 10:33; Lu 24:7; Ac 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-31","title":"John 18:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>Take. 19:6,7; Ac 25:18-20 It. 19:15; Ge 49:10; Eze 21:26,27; Ho 3:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-32","title":"John 18:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the saying. 3:14; 10:31,33; 12:32,33; Mt 20:19; 26:2; Lu 18:32,33; 24:7,8 Ac 7:59 what. De 21:23; Ps 22:16; Ga 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-33","title":"John 18:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>and said. 37; Mt 27:11; Mr 15:2; Lu 23:3,4; 1Ti 6:13 the king. 1:49; 12:13,15; 19:3,19-22; Ps 2:6-12; Isa 9:6,7; Jer 23:5; Zep 3:15 Zec 9:9; Lu 19:38-40; Ac 2:34-36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-18-34","title":"John 18:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":34},"